<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Cause Panic</h1>
<p>Sphere: Mind Sphere
Spell Tier: 4
Class: Necromancer (guild level 42)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast cause panic &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast cause panic</a>   (at whoever you are fighting)
</pre>
<p>The caster stares deep into the target's eyes and slowly fills them with 
fear. The target first resists with their mind; if the spell takes hold, 
then every few seconds they have to fight the fear again, and each time 
their mind fails them, they flee in panic. The stronger the spell, the 
longer it lasts, from a few seconds to several minutes, until the target 
feels calm again. A strong calm spell ends it sooner. Someone already in 
a panic can't be panicked more.
</p><p>Casting it is an attack and starts a fight, even if the spell fails. It 
can be cast while fighting, but not on yourself, and it isn't found on 
scrolls or other items. Practising it needs divine 84.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Calm</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Fear</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Mind Sphere</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Necromancer</a>
</pre>




</div>